Package: python3-ghee
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, python3-numpy, python3-pil
Recommends: ffmpeg
Description: multi-pass GLSL renderer for small Linux devices
 ghee compiles a set of fragment shaders (a scene), renders them
 off-screen with GLES2 through DRM/GBM, and writes the pixels to image
 files, SPI panels, an HDMI display, or an H264 or MJPEG stream. No
 window system required.
 .
 Ships the ghee CLI and a browser-based live shader console.
 .
 ffmpeg is only needed on boards without the Broadcom H264 encoder,
 where the software encoder shells out to it.
